#message 1 "Millhaven Police Department, 7:00 AM. Your first week on the force. Sergeant Prakash is at the front desk, moving forms between three trays."
#message 2 "The precinct lobby. Sergeant Prakash stands behind the front desk. A bulletin board and an equipment shelf hang on the wall. The Records Office door is on the left; glass doors lead out to Main Street on the right."
#message 3 "\"Reyes. Good, you're awake. Hollis Pharmacy on Main Street was broken into last night. A Swiftline delivery driver, Gus Tully, called it in. He says he saw a man run from the back door at 2:10 AM.\""
